 | 6     | 1-n  | 0-terminated string | The responding program name + version as a string. E.g. "dbg_uart_if v2.0.0"                                                                    |
 
+Machine type UNKNOWN (0): the generic "dzrp" remote then takes the memory model from 'customMemory' in the 'dzrp' launch.json configuration.
+The slot contents returned by CMD_GET_REGISTERS are the bank indices of that 'customMemory', and the bank numbers of long addresses (bank+1) and of CMD_READ_BANK_MEM/CMD_WRITE_BANK_MEM refer to it as well.
+
 
